culture zh-Hans
namespace UObjectToolTips

EDreamScrollCoordinateMode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#EDreamScrollCoordinateMode
    src   "EDreamUIScrollDestination and EDreamUIScrollWhenFocusChanges used to be declared here, and moved to\nDreamScrollTypes.h when the layout container needed to speak them too: a behaviour and a layout\ncontainer cannot include each other, and the question is neither one's property."
    text  "EDreamUIScrollDestination 和 EDreamUIScrollWhenFocusChanges 过去在此处声明，后来布局容器也需要用到它们，\n便移到了 DreamScrollTypes.h：行为与布局容器\n不能互相包含，而这个问题也不属于任何一方的属性。"
    state machine
}

