UIScrollView:AnalogMouseWheelKey {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:AnalogMouseWheelKey
    src   "The analog key that acts as this view's mouse wheel -- UMG's AnalogMouseWheelKey.\n\nInvalid (the default) means \"whatever the input preset already routes here\", which is the right\nstick on both axes and therefore exactly today's behaviour. Naming a key narrows it to that key:\nthe preset only binds the right stick's two axes, so a view that names one of them scrolls from\nthat axis alone, and a view that names anything else scrolls from a binding the project adds."
    text  "充当此视图鼠标滚轮的模拟键——即 UMG 的 AnalogMouseWheelKey。\n\n无效（默认值）表示“输入预设已经路由到这里的任何输入”，也就是两个轴上的右摇杆，\n因而与当前行为完全一致。指定某个键会将其收窄到该键：预设只绑定右摇杆的两个轴，\n因此指定其中一个轴的视图仅从该轴滚动，而指定其他任何键的视图\n则从项目添加的绑定滚动。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:bAllowOverscroll {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:bAllowOverscroll
    src   "Whether the content may be pulled past an end and spring back -- UMG's AllowOverscroll.\n\nOff does NOT mean OutOfRangeDamper is zero for good: the damper stays the author's number and\nthis is the switch in front of it, so turning overscroll back on restores whatever feel was\ntuned. Everything that reads the damper goes through GetEffectiveOutOfRangeDamper."
    text  "内容是否可以被拉过末端并弹回——即 UMG 的 AllowOverscroll。\n\n关闭并不表示 OutOfRangeDamper 永久为零：阻尼值仍是作者设定的数字，\n这只是它前面的开关，因此重新开启过卷会恢复此前调好的手感。\n所有读取阻尼的地方都经过 GetEffectiveOutOfRangeDamper。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:bAllowRightClickDragScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:bAllowRightClickDragScrolling
    src   "Whether a drag with the RIGHT button scrolls this view -- UMG's bAllowRightClickDragScrolling.\nOff leaves the right button to whatever wants it for a context menu. On, the drag scrolls from\nthe press, the move that crossed the drag threshold included, as SScrollBox's does; the left\nbutton and a finger start scrolling from where the drag was recognised."
    text  "使用右键拖动是否滚动此视图——即 UMG 的 bAllowRightClickDragScrolling。\n关闭时，右键留给任何需要它打开上下文菜单的地方。开启时，拖动从按下时就开始滚动，\n包括越过拖动阈值的那次移动，与 SScrollBox 的行为一致；左键和手指\n则从识别出拖动的位置开始滚动。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:bAnimateTouchScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:bAnimateTouchScrolling
    src   "Whether a TOUCH drag eases to a stop like the wheel does -- UMG's bInEnableTouchAnimatedScrolling.\n\nSeparate from bAnimateWheelScrolling because a finger already carries its own momentum: gliding\na gesture that was never discrete is a second ease on top of the one the player made."
    text  "触摸拖动是否像滚轮一样缓动停止——即 UMG 的 bInEnableTouchAnimatedScrolling。\n\n与 bAnimateWheelScrolling 分开，因为手指本身已带有惯性：让一个从来不是离散的手势滑行，\n是在玩家自己做出的缓动之上再加一层缓动。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:bAnimateWheelScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:bAnimateWheelScrolling
    src   "A wheel notch GLIDES to its destination instead of teleporting -- UMG's AnimateWheelScrolling.\n\nOff by default, which is the behaviour every existing view already has: turning it on for\neveryone would change how every list in every project reads under the wheel. It uses the same\neasing ScrollTo does, so a notch and a programmatic scroll move the content one way."
    text  "滚轮的一格会滑行到目标位置，而不是瞬移——即 UMG 的 AnimateWheelScrolling。\n\n默认关闭，这也是每个现有视图已经具有的行为：如果对所有人开启，\n会改变每个项目中每个列表在滚轮下的手感。它使用与 ScrollTo 相同的缓动，\n因此滚轮的一格和程序化滚动会以相同方式移动内容。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:bBackPadScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:bBackPadScrolling
    src   "A whole window of empty space BEFORE the content, so the first item can be scrolled all the way\nto the trailing edge -- UMG's BackPadScrolling, and Slate's arithmetic (a full view, not half).\n\nBoth pads move the point the offset is measured from, which is why GetStartAlignedPosition owns\nthem rather than each caller adding its own term: the ranges, the progress and the reveal maths\nall read that one function, so they cannot disagree about where zero is."
    text  "在内容之前留出整整一屏的空白，使第一个项可以一直滚动到尾部边缘——即 UMG 的 BackPadScrolling，\n采用 Slate 的算法（一整屏，而非半屏）。\n\n两个填充都会移动偏移量的测量原点，因此由 GetStartAlignedPosition 统一处理，\n而不是让每个调用方各自增加一项：范围、进度和显现计算\n都读取同一个函数，所以它们不会对零点位置产生分歧。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:bEnableTouchScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:bEnableTouchScrolling
    src   "Whether a TOUCH drag scrolls this view -- UMG's bEnableTouchScrolling. A mouse drag is unaffected."
    text  "触摸拖动是否滚动此视图——即 UMG 的 bEnableTouchScrolling。鼠标拖动不受影响。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:bFrontPadScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:bFrontPadScrolling
    src   "A whole window of empty space AFTER the content -- UMG's FrontPadScrolling."
    text  "在内容之后留出整整一屏的空白——即 UMG 的 FrontPadScrolling。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:bIsGamepadScrollingEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:bIsGamepadScrollingEnabled
    src   "The same switch for the analog stick -- UMG's bIsGamepadScrollingEnabled.\n\nRead by FDreamUINavigationScroll beside AnalogMouseWheelKey: the key says which axis reaches\nthis view, and this says whether any does."
    text  "模拟摇杆的同类开关——即 UMG 的 bIsGamepadScrollingEnabled。\n\n由 FDreamUINavigationScroll 与 AnalogMouseWheelKey 一同读取：该键指明哪个轴到达\n此视图，而此项指明是否有轴到达。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:bIsPointerScrollingEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:bIsPointerScrollingEnabled
    src   "The master switch over POINTER scrolling -- UMG's bIsPointerScrollingEnabled.\n\nThe wheel AND the drag together, because they are one gesture set: a view that answers the\nwheel but not the drag is one whose scroll bar is the only way down. Asked in front of the\nper-gesture switches, which are about WHICH pointer gesture rather than whether any of them."
    text  "指针滚动的总开关——即 UMG 的 bIsPointerScrollingEnabled。\n\n滚轮和拖拽一起管，因为它们属于同一组手势：只响应滚轮而不响应拖拽的视图，\n滚动条就成了唯一的下拉途径。此开关位于各手势开关之前，\n后者关心的是用哪一种指针手势，而不是是否启用其中任一种。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:CanScrollInSmallSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:CanScrollInSmallSize
    src   "When Content size is smaller than Content's parent size, can we still drag it (and have it spring back)?\n\nOff by default, as UMG's scroll box holds its offset at zero while its bar is not needed: content that fits\ncannot be pulled past its ends, neither by the drag nor by the fling after it, and a drag over a view with\nnothing to scroll on either axis is handed on to whatever is behind it. On, content that fits can be dragged\nout of place and springs back when let go."
    text  "当 Content 尺寸小于 Content 的父级尺寸时，是否仍可拖拽它（并在松手后弹回）？\n\n默认关闭，因为 UMG 的滚动框在不需要滚动条时会把偏移量保持为零：放得下的内容\n无法被拖过两端，拖拽和其后的甩动都不行；在任一轴上都没有可滚动内容的视图上拖拽，\n事件会传递给其后面的对象。开启后，放得下的内容可以被拖离原位，\n并在松手时弹回。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:CanScrollOnAxis {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:CanScrollOnAxis
    src   "True when this view scrolls on that axis AND there is something to scroll."
    text  "当此视图在该轴上可滚动，且确实有可滚动的内容时为真。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:CanScrollWidgetIntoView {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:CanScrollWidgetIntoView
    src   "True when InChild sits inside this view and a scroll would bring more of it into sight."
    text  "当 InChild 位于此视图内，且滚动能让它更多部分进入视野时为真。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:ConsumeMouseWheel {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:ConsumeMouseWheel
    src   "Whether a wheel event this view acted on is swallowed here or handed to an outer scrolling\nancestor -- UMG's ConsumeMouseWheel.\n\nWhenScrollingPossible is what this component has always done: it scrolls and consumes while\nthere is somewhere left to go, and hands the event on once it is at a limit, which is what makes\na list inside a scrolling page behave. Never stops the wheel driving this view at all; Always\nkeeps the event even at a limit, so the page behind never moves."
    text  "此视图处理过的滚轮事件是在此处被吞掉，还是交给外层可滚动的祖先——\nUMG 的 ConsumeMouseWheel。\n\nWhenScrollingPossible 是此组件一直以来的行为：只要还有可去的地方，它就滚动并吞掉事件；\n一旦到达边界，就把事件传递出去，这正是滚动页面内的列表\n能正常工作的原因。Never 完全不会阻止滚轮驱动此视图；\nAlways 即使到达边界也保留事件，因此后面的页面永远不会移动。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:Content {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:Content
    src   "Content can move inside it's parent area."
    text  "Content 可以在其父级区域内移动。"
