UIScrollView:DecelerateRate {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:DecelerateRate
    src   "Determines how quickly the contents stop moving. A value of 0 means the movement will never slow down, larger value will stop the movement faster."
    text  "决定内容停止移动的速度。值为 0 表示移动永不减速，值越大，移动停止得越快。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:EndInertialScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:EndInertialScrolling
    src   "Drop the fling, keeping the position -- UMG's EndInertialScrolling.\n\nThe spring is deliberately left armed when the content is out of range: a rubber band pulled\nopen is not inertia, and abandoning it there would leave the content parked outside its own\nrange with nothing left to walk it back."
    text  "终止甩动并保持当前位置——UMG的EndInertialScrolling。\n\n当内容超出范围时，弹簧会被有意保持启用：被拉开的橡皮筋并不是惯性，\n若此时放弃它，内容就会停在自己的范围之外，\n再也没有东西能把它带回来。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:FlipDirectionInSmallSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:FlipDirectionInSmallSize
    src   "When Content size is smaller than Content's parent size, rest it against the END edge instead of the start."
    text  "当 Content 尺寸小于 Content 父级尺寸时，让其贴靠末端边缘而不是起始边缘。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:GetConsumePointerInput {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:GetConsumePointerInput
    src   "Whether a pointer event this view handled is swallowed -- UMG's bConsumePointerInput, which is\nthe inverse of the AllowEventBubbleUp this component was written with. One stored bit, asked\nboth ways round, rather than two that can disagree."
    text  "此视图处理过的指针事件是否被吞掉——UMG的bConsumePointerInput，它是此组件编写时所用\nAllowEventBubbleUp的反面。只存一个位，用两种方式提问，\n而不是两个可能互相矛盾的位。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:GetContentSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:GetContentSize
    src   "The scrolled content's size. Zero when this view is not wired up yet."
