    state machine
}

UIScrollView:GetContentViewport {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:GetContentViewport
    src   "The window: the content's PARENT. This component never stores a viewport of its own -- which\nis also why the name is not GetViewport: UUIScrollViewWithScrollbar has one of those, and it\nmeans an authored widget the bars shrink rather than the rect the content slides inside."
    text  "窗口：即内容的父项。此组件从不存储自己的视口——这也是名称不是GetViewport的原因：\nUUIScrollViewWithScrollbar有一个视口，它指的是滚动条会缩小的制作好的控件，\n而不是内容在其中滑动的矩形。"
    state machine
}

