    state machine
}

UIScrollView:GetOverscrollOffset {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:GetOverscrollOffset
    src   "Signed distance past an end, per axis, in the reading direction: negative before the start,\npositive past the end, zero in range -- SScrollBox::GetOverscrollOffset's answer. Always zero\nwhile overscroll is off, because there is then nothing that could be out there."
    text  "按轴计算、沿阅读方向超出末端的带符号距离：起点之前为负，\n超出末端为正，在范围内为零——即SScrollBox::GetOverscrollOffset的返回值。\n过度滚动关闭时始终为零，因为此时范围外不可能有任何内容。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:GetOverscrollPercentage {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:GetOverscrollPercentage
    src   "The same distance as a PERCENTAGE of the window on that axis, which is what UMG reports."
    text  "同一距离在该轴上占窗口的百分比，即UMG所报告的值。"
