}

UIScrollView:GetScrollableExtent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:GetScrollableExtent
    src   "How far there is to go, per axis: max(0, content - viewport). Zero on an axis that fits."
    text  "按轴计算还可滚动的距离：max(0, content - viewport)。在内容刚好放得下的轴上为零。"
