UIScrollView:GetScrollOffset {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:GetScrollOffset
    src   "How far the window has travelled from the content's start edge, in local units: X rightward,\nY DOWNWARD. The reading direction on both axes, which is why neither one is inverted here and\nthe two progress values mean the same thing as each other."
    text  "窗口从内容起始边缘移动了多远，以本地单位计：X向右，\nY向下。两轴均沿阅读方向，因此这里两者都没有反转，\n两个进度值的含义彼此相同。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:GetVerticalRange {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:GetVerticalRange
    src   "Get Content's position range in vertical."
    text  "获取内容在垂直方向上的位置范围。"
