UIScrollView:GetViewportSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:GetViewportSize
    src   "The window's own size -- the content's parent rect. Zero when this view is not wired up yet."
    text  "窗口自身的大小——即内容父项的矩形。此视图尚未连接时为零。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:GlideToScrollOffset {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:GlideToScrollOffset
    src   "SetScrollOffset that glides there over InDuration seconds, with the easing ScrollTo uses: the same offset, clamped\nthe same way, other axes left alone; 0 or less jumps, as SetScrollOffset does. Anything that moves the content\nmeanwhile -- a drag, a wheel notch, a setter, another glide -- stops it where it got to. IsScrolling stays true\nuntil it lands, so a list's OnListViewFinishedScrolling is said once, after it."
    text  "在InDuration秒内平滑滑到该位置的SetScrollOffset，使用ScrollTo所用的缓动：偏移量相同，以相同方式钳制，\n其他轴不受影响；0或更小则直接跳转，与SetScrollOffset一样。期间任何移动内容的操作\n——拖拽、滚轮一格、某个设置函数、另一次滑动——都会让它停在当前到达的位置。IsScrolling在抵达前保持为true，\n因此列表的OnListViewFinishedScrolling会在其之后仅触发一次。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:IsScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:IsScrolling
    src   "True while momentum, a spring-back or a glide (ScrollTo, ScrollWidgetIntoView, GlideToScrollOffset, an animated\nwheel notch) still has the content moving -- UMG's GetIsScrolling."
    text  "当惯性、回弹或滑动（ScrollTo、ScrollWidgetIntoView、GlideToScrollOffset、带动画的一格\n滚轮等滚动控件的动作）仍在移动内容时为true——即UMG的GetIsScrolling。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:KeepProgress {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:KeepProgress
    src   "Keep progress value when content position and size change.\ntrue- keep progress value and change content's position and size to fit progress.\nfalse- keep the offset, and let the progress follow from it."
    text  "内容位置和大小变化时保持进度值。\ntrue——保持进度值，并改变内容的位置和大小以匹配进度。\nfalse——保持偏移量，让进度随之变化。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:NavigationDestination {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:NavigationDestination
    src   "Where a revealed widget is meant to END UP -- UMG's NavigationDestination, consulted by\nScrollWidgetIntoView and therefore by every navigation move (FDreamUINavigationScroll)."
    text  "被显示的控件最终应到达的位置——即UMG的NavigationDestination，由\nScrollWidgetIntoView查询，因而也被每一次导航移动查询（FDreamUINavigationScroll）。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:NavigationScrollPadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:NavigationScrollPadding
    src   "How much of the window to keep clear around a revealed widget, in local units -- UMG's\nNavigationScrollPadding. Stops a row landing flush against the edge with its neighbour cut in\nhalf beside it, which is the only cue a player has that the list continues."
    text  "在被显示的控件周围要留出多少窗口空间作为填充，以本地单位计——即 UMG 的\nNavigationScrollPadding。可避免某一行紧贴边缘、相邻项在旁边被裁掉一半，\n而那正是玩家判断列表仍有后续的唯一线索。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:OnlyOneDirection {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:OnlyOneDirection
    src   "If allow Horizontal and Vertical both, then only allow one direction drag at the same time."
    text  "如果同时允许水平和垂直方向，则同一时间只允许沿一个方向拖动。"
    state machine
