UIScrollView:ScrollSensitivity {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:ScrollSensitivity
    src   "Local units travelled per mouse-wheel notch. 40 is what UDreamLayoutContainerScrollBox already\nuses for the same gesture; the 1.0 this shipped with was a MULTIPLIER on the raw axis value,\nwhich meant one unit per notch and a wheel that visibly did nothing."
    text  "每个鼠标滚轮刻度移动的本地单位数。UDreamLayoutContainerScrollBox对相同手势已经使用40；\n此前发布的1.0是对原始轴值的乘数，\n这意味着每个刻度只有一个单位，滚轮看起来毫无效果。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:ScrollTo {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:ScrollTo
    src   "Try to scroll the scrollview so the child can sit at center. Will clamp it in valid range.\n@param InChild Target child actor.\n@param InEaseAnimation true-use tween animation to make smooth scroll, false-immediate set.\n@param InAnimationDuration Animation duration if InEaseAnimation = true."
    text  "尝试滚动滚动视图，使子项居中。会将其限制在有效范围内。\n@param InChild 目标子Actor。\n@param InEaseAnimation true-使用补间动画实现平滑滚动，false-立即设置。\n@param InAnimationDuration 当 InEaseAnimation = true 时的动画时长。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:ScrollWhenFocusChanges {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:ScrollWhenFocusChanges
    src   "What this view does when user focus lands inside it -- UMG's ScrollWhenFocusChanges. Read by\nFDreamUINavigationScroll, which is the only thing that reveals a widget because focus moved."
    text  "当用户焦点落在其中时此视图的行为——即UMG的ScrollWhenFocusChanges。由\nFDreamUINavigationScroll读取，它是唯一因焦点移动而显示控件的东西。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:ScrollWidgetIntoView {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:ScrollWidgetIntoView
    src   "Scroll the least distance that brings InChild fully inside the viewport, and nothing at all when\nit is already there. ScrollTo always centres, which reads badly under directional navigation:\nstepping one row down would heave the whole list to put that row in the middle.\n\n@param InDestination Where the child ends up. Configured (the default) leaves it to this view's\n                     own NavigationDestination, which is what every caller meant before the\n                     parameter existed.\n@param InPadding     How much of the window to keep clear around it. Negative leaves it to this\n                     view's NavigationScrollPadding, for the same reason.\n@return true when the content position actually moved."
    text  "以最小距离滚动，使InChild完全位于视口内，若它已在那里则完全不滚动。ScrollTo始终居中，这在方向导航下\n效果很差：向下移动一行会把整个列表拽动，\n好让该行位于中间。\n\n@param InDestination 子项最终的位置。Configured（默认值）交由此视图自身的\n                     NavigationDestination，这也是该参数出现之前\n                     所有调用者的本意。\n@param InPadding     在其周围保留多少窗口空间作为填充。负值出于同样的原因\n                     交由此视图的NavigationScrollPadding决定。\n@return 当内容位置实际发生移动时返回true。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:SetScrollDelta {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:SetScrollDelta
    src   "Manually scroll it with delta value, in CONTENT-POSITION units (Y up, the engine's sign)."
    text  "使用增量值手动滚动，单位为内容位置单位（Y 向上，即引擎的符号约定）。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:SetScrollOffset {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:SetScrollOffset
    src   "Clamped to the extent on every axis this view scrolls; axes it does not scroll are left alone."
    text  "在此视图滚动的每个轴上都会被限制到内容范围内；不滚动的轴则保持不变。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:SetScrollProgress {
