UIScrollView:WheelProgressStep {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:WheelProgressStep
    src   "If greater than zero, mouse wheel input advances by this normalized progress instead of local units."
    text  "如果大于零，鼠标滚轮输入将通过此归一化进度值进行滚动，而不是本地单位。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:WheelScrollAnimationDuration {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:WheelScrollAnimationDuration
    src   "How long one animated notch takes. Ignored while bAnimateWheelScrolling is off."
    text  "一格动画滚动所需的时间。bAnimateWheelScrolling 关闭时忽略。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollView:WheelScrollMultiplier {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollView.h#UIScrollView:WheelScrollMultiplier
    src   "A plain multiplier on whatever one wheel notch already travels -- UMG's WheelScrollMultiplier,\nand the reason it is a second number beside ScrollSensitivity rather than folded into it:\nScrollSensitivity is the DISTANCE a notch covers (local units, or a progress fraction when\nWheelProgressStep is set), and this scales it. A project that wants \"the same feel, twice as\nfast\" writes 2 here and leaves the distance alone, which is what the list controls already mean\nby the same name."
    text  "对一格滚轮已经移动的距离施加的简单倍率——即UMG的WheelScrollMultiplier，\n也是它作为ScrollSensitivity旁边第二个数值、而非并入其中的原因：\nScrollSensitivity是一格滚轮覆盖的距离（本地单位，或设置WheelProgressStep时的进度比例），\n此项则对这个距离进行缩放。想要“相同手感、速度翻倍”的项目\n在这里写2并保持距离不变，\n这也是列表控件中同名参数的含义。"
    state machine
}

